Package: heatready
Title: Client for the HeatReady Heat-Risk API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CrisisReady", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "datascience_crisisready@harvard.edu")
Description: Thin R client for the HeatReady API, a single-endpoint REST
    service serving neighborhood-resolution heat-risk metrics derived from
    ERA5 climate reanalysis data. Provides an R6 client class with one
    method per API action (listing/creating/fetching projects, heat-risk
    metrics, vulnerability, air quality, and land-surface-temperature data)
    plus a paging helper for downloading a whole project's metrics history.
